{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6fd5b276e8f6c908","name":"Lightning Burst","source":{"id":"source:reference-6fd5b276e8f6c908","title":"Lightning Burst","revision":20239,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:28:03Z","sha256":"05a27af081b4058b25b648aacb2e5182edb3ed8ff39fff0172067c4734b1460f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20239","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lightning%20Burst&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6fd5b276e8f6c908","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You call upon ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," to cause lightning to arc out from your body, striking adjacent enemies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["[",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"]"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," All enemies adjacent to you.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," Compare the result to each target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the attack hits, the target takes 3d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage and moves -1 step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". If the attack misses, the target takes half damage and does not move along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You may spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," when you activate this Force Power to increase the damage dealt by +2d6.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maintain the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lightning Burst"]}," Force Power as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", provided you haven't moved since activating the Force Power. When you maintain a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lightning Burst"]},", make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of each target in range (as described above).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
